        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Assembly: K = Σ P_eᵀ k_e P_e, B = Σ P_eᵀ b_e P_e (k_e = k_v ⊕ k_φ, b_e = k_q − k_M − k_Mᵀ).",
